m</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Sexton</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Weiss</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Hilsenbeck</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Lamph</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Negro-Vilar</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Johnson</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Elledge</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Prevention of breast cancer using rexinoids: results of a phase II biomarker modulation trial using bexarotene in women at high risk of breast caner</article-title><source>30th Annual San Antonio Breast Cancer Symposium</source><year>2007</year><publisher-name>San Antonio: Breast Cancer Research and Treatment</publisher-name><fpage>S181</fpage>Lippman ME (ed) Vol. 106, pp</citation></ref><ref id="bib7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Campiglio</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Normanno</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Menard</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Re: Effect of epidermal growth factor receptor inhibitor on development of estrogen receptor-negative mammary tumors</article-title><source>J Natl Cancer Inst</source><year>2004</year><volume>96</volume><fpage>715</fpage>author reply 715&#x02013;716<!--PubMed citation query: 'J Natl Cancer Inst||96|715||bib7|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15126613</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Christov</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Grubbs</surname><given-names>CJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Shilkaitis</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Juliana</surname><given-names>MM</given-names></name><